1
00:00:10,984 --> 00:00:20,069
<font color="#06cdf8">jmg subs</font>

2
00:01:51,378 --> 00:01:54,291
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hi. I'm Elise.
You must be Lorraine.</b></font>

3
00:01:54,381 --> 00:01:57,624
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yes. Nice to meet you.
I'm sorry it's so late.</b></font>

4
00:01:57,718 --> 00:02:00,824
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>My day job kind of makes
raising my son a night job.</b></font>

5
00:02:00,921 --> 00:02:02,264
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Don't worry about it.</b></font>

6
00:02:02,322 --> 00:02:06,134
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>In my line of work, things tend
to happen when it gets dark.</b></font>

7
00:02:06,226 --> 00:02:07,569
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Please.
Thank you.</b></font>

8
00:02:15,669 --> 00:02:16,739
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Ahoy, Carl!</b></font>

9
00:02:18,505 --> 00:02:20,644
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Elise, thank you for coming.</b></font>

10
00:02:21,241 --> 00:02:24,154
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I didn't know what else
to do, except call you.</b></font>

11
00:02:24,244 --> 00:02:25,951
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Oh, I understand.</b></font>

12
00:02:26,013 --> 00:02:27,822
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You had a big problem
and you thought</b></font>

13
00:02:27,914 --> 00:02:30,155
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>you'd make it my problem, too.
Is that it'?</b></font>

14
00:02:31,518 --> 00:02:32,656
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Uh, uh..</b></font>

15
00:02:32,753 --> 00:02:34,494
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm teasing.</b></font>

16
00:02:34,588 --> 00:02:37,432
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You know I'm always
happy to help, Carl.</b></font>

17
00:02:37,491 --> 00:02:39,437
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Would you like
some coffee or tea?</b></font>

18
00:02:39,493 --> 00:02:41,336
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No, thank you.</b></font>

19
00:02:41,428 --> 00:02:43,999
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'd like to get started
right away, if that's okay.</b></font>

20
00:02:44,097 --> 00:02:45,633
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Carl told me on the phone</b></font>

21
00:02:45,699 --> 00:02:48,339
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>your son is the one
affected, is that right?</b></font>

22
00:02:48,435 --> 00:02:49,846
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yes, that's right.</b></font>

23
00:02:49,936 --> 00:02:51,438
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>My son, Josh.</b></font>

24
00:02:52,305 --> 00:02:54,307
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Something is following him.</b></font>

25
00:02:56,343 --> 00:02:57,879
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Show her.</b></font>

26
00:03:00,313 --> 00:03:02,554
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I started with
all the usual checks,</b></font>

27
00:03:02,649 --> 00:03:04,993
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>mental health tests,
medical records.</b></font>

28
00:03:05,052 --> 00:03:06,656
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Everything normal.</b></font>

29
00:03:08,622 --> 00:03:09,896
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Then I saw the photos.</b></font>

30
00:03:11,324 --> 00:03:14,203
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>First noticed it
about six weeks ago.</b></font>

31
00:03:14,294 --> 00:03:16,706
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Thought it was
a camera problem.</b></font>

32
00:03:16,797 --> 00:03:19,710
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Then it became apparent
that it was more than that.</b></font>

33
00:03:21,301 --> 00:03:22,871
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I interviewed the boy.</b></font>

34
00:03:23,804 --> 00:03:25,750
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>He won't tell me anything.
He's afraid.</b></font>

35
00:03:28,141 --> 00:03:29,484
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm afraid, too.</b></font>

36
00:03:29,810 --> 00:03:32,848
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>There's something in this house.
I can feel it.</b></font>

37
00:03:33,547 --> 00:03:35,083
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It doesn't want me here.</b></font>

38
00:03:55,168 --> 00:03:56,613
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>May I meet him?</b></font>

39
00:03:59,272 --> 00:04:01,752
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Hi, Josh. I'm Elise.</i></b></font>

40
00:04:01,842 --> 00:04:04,550
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>I would love to ask you
some simple questions.</i></b></font>

41
00:04:05,178 --> 00:04:06,748
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Do you like living here?</i></b></font>

42
00:04:06,847 --> 00:04:08,918
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yeah, I guess</b></font>

43
00:04:09,015 --> 00:04:11,791
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Are there a lot of kids your
age in this neighborhood?</b></font>

44
00:04:12,619 --> 00:04:15,600
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>A few.
One kid lives next door.</i></b></font>

45
00:04:15,689 --> 00:04:17,293
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>That must be fun.</b></font>

46
00:04:17,891 --> 00:04:22,237
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Is there anything you don't like
about living in this house?</b></font>

47
00:04:28,101 --> 00:04:29,808
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>I have bad dreams sometimes.</i></b></font>

48
00:04:30,370 --> 00:04:32,213
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What happens in your dreams?</b></font>

49
00:04:36,610 --> 00:04:39,113
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'd like to try something
with you, Josh.</b></font>

50
00:04:39,212 --> 00:04:42,159
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>And I promise, it won't hurt.</b></font>

51
00:04:47,721 --> 00:04:49,723
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I want you to just relax.</b></font>

52
00:04:51,558 --> 00:04:53,435
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Listen to the ticking.</b></font>

53
00:04:53,493 --> 00:04:54,972
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Focus on it.</b></font>

54
00:04:55,061 --> 00:04:57,063
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Tune everything else out.</b></font>

55
00:04:58,298 --> 00:05:00,608
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Feel yourself getting sleepier.</b></font>

56
00:05:03,336 --> 00:05:05,748
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We are now inside
your dream, Josh.</b></font>

57
00:05:06,306 --> 00:05:08,183
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Look around.</b></font>

58
00:05:08,275 --> 00:05:09,777
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What do you see?</b></font>

59
00:05:12,612 --> 00:05:14,353
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I see myself</b></font>

60
00:05:15,315 --> 00:05:17,352
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>sleeping in bed.</b></font>

61
00:05:17,450 --> 00:05:19,430
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Are you in your bedroom?</b></font>

62
00:05:20,420 --> 00:05:22,297
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No.</b></font>

63
00:05:22,355 --> 00:05:24,266
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm somewhere dark.</b></font>

64
00:05:24,991 --> 00:05:26,664
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's always dark here.</b></font>

65
00:05:26,760 --> 00:05:28,535
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Are you alone?</b></font>

66
00:05:29,830 --> 00:05:31,275
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No.</b></font>

67
00:05:32,332 --> 00:05:33,640
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She's here.</b></font>

68
00:05:33,700 --> 00:05:35,145
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Who is "she"?</b></font>

69
00:05:36,002 --> 00:05:38,380
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She says she's a friend.</b></font>

70
00:05:39,506 --> 00:05:41,713
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She visits me every night.</b></font>

71
00:05:42,776 --> 00:05:45,450
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Where is she
right at this moment?</b></font>

72
00:05:46,046 --> 00:05:48,617
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Is she here in
this house with us?</b></font>

73
00:05:49,883 --> 00:05:51,885
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'd like to talk to her.</b></font>

74
00:06:01,127 --> 00:06:05,405
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Okay, we're gonna play
a little game, Josh.</b></font>

75
00:06:05,498 --> 00:06:07,478
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's called Hot and Cold.</b></font>

76
00:06:08,034 --> 00:06:10,014
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>I'll walk around the house,</i></b></font>

77
00:06:10,070 --> 00:06:14,041
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>and you tell me if I'm
getting warmer or colder.</i></b></font>

78
00:06:24,885 --> 00:06:26,489
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Cold.</b></font>

79
00:06:42,002 --> 00:06:43,174
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Warm.</b></font>

80
00:07:04,424 --> 00:07:05,869
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Warmer.</i></b></font>

81
00:07:17,137 --> 00:07:19,208
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Colder.</b></font>

82
00:07:44,931 --> 00:07:46,604
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Getting warm.</i></b></font>

83
00:07:54,474 --> 00:07:56,317
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hotter.</b></font>

84
00:08:00,747 --> 00:08:02,249
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's very hot.</b></font>

85
00:08:16,763 --> 00:08:19,004
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Please get out of there.</b></font>

86
00:08:22,836 --> 00:08:24,543
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Who are you?</b></font>

87
00:08:25,705 --> 00:08:27,309
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What do you want?</b></font>

88
00:08:47,027 --> 00:08:48,028
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What happened?</b></font>

89
00:08:48,128 --> 00:08:50,199
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I saw what haunts him,
and it's not a friend.</b></font>

90
00:08:50,296 --> 00:08:54,142
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's a, parasite. I've never
felt such a malignant presence.</b></font>

91
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:56,180
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It wants to be him.</b></font>

92
00:08:56,302 --> 00:08:57,576
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Miss Lambert,</b></font>

93
00:08:57,670 --> 00:09:01,243
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I think your son has a
unique ability a gift.</b></font>

94
00:09:01,341 --> 00:09:05,187
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>When he sleeps at night, he's
able to go places, see things.</b></font>

95
00:09:06,146 --> 00:09:08,717
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Things no living person
is supposed to see.</b></font>

96
00:09:09,482 --> 00:09:13,396
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Only now, one of the
dead has seen him, too.</b></font>

97
00:09:13,920 --> 00:09:15,365
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Oh.. my God.</b></font>

98
00:09:17,157 --> 00:09:18,500
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Well, can you stop it'?</b></font>

99
00:09:20,493 --> 00:09:21,904
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I could take away his gift</b></font>

100
00:09:21,995 --> 00:09:24,441
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>to suppress his memory
of his ability.</b></font>

101
00:09:24,531 --> 00:09:25,874
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>How would we do that'?</b></font>

102
00:09:32,238 --> 00:09:34,047
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'll show you.</b></font>

103
00:10:05,939 --> 00:10:09,409
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Do whatever you have to
Make him forget.</b></font>

104
00:12:47,033 --> 00:12:50,708
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>One morning, Dalton
just wouldn't wake up.</b></font>

105
00:12:52,205 --> 00:12:54,481
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We took him to the best
doctors we could find,</b></font>

106
00:12:54,574 --> 00:12:57,282
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>but none of them had any idea.</b></font>

107
00:12:58,044 --> 00:13:01,582
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Eventually,
we just took him home,</b></font>

108
00:13:01,648 --> 00:13:03,719
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>still in his coma.</b></font>

109
00:13:04,550 --> 00:13:08,088
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Then things started
happening around the house.</b></font>

110
00:13:09,122 --> 00:13:10,624
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Unexplained things.</b></font>

111
00:13:10,723 --> 00:13:13,294
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I got so freaked out, we moved.</b></font>

112
00:13:13,393 --> 00:13:15,395
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>But they kept happening.</b></font>

113
00:13:15,962 --> 00:13:21,310
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>And you believe that there was
some sort of supernatural force at work?</b></font>

114
00:13:23,569 --> 00:13:26,277
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>When did you hire the services</b></font>

115
00:13:26,339 --> 00:13:28,341
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>of the deceased Elise Rainier?</b></font>

116
00:13:29,575 --> 00:13:32,419
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>When we ran out
of places to go.</b></font>

117
00:13:33,780 --> 00:13:36,317
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It says in your
statement, Mrs. Lambert,</b></font>

118
00:13:36,416 --> 00:13:40,330
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>that last night, at
approximately 10:00 p.m.,</b></font>

119
00:13:40,420 --> 00:13:44,300
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Elise put your husband
into a state of hypnosis.</b></font>

120
00:13:44,357 --> 00:13:47,167
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She did this <i>as</i>
part of a ritual that</b></font>

121
00:13:47,260 --> 00:13:50,833
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>she believed would allow him to</b></font>

122
00:13:50,930 --> 00:13:56,175
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>"project his unconscious
into a.." Uh..</b></font>

123
00:13:56,269 --> 00:13:59,375
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm sorry, I can't read
my own handwriting.</b></font>

124
00:13:59,472 --> 00:14:04,353
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>"..Into a spirit realm, where
he could locate your son</b></font>

125
00:14:04,444 --> 00:14:08,017
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>"and bring him back
to consciousness."</b></font>

126
00:14:10,950 --> 00:14:14,955
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Now, did you really
believe that would help?</b></font>

127
00:14:16,823 --> 00:14:19,861
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I had to. Whatever
she did, it worked.</b></font>

128
00:14:19,959 --> 00:14:21,802
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Dalton woke up.</b></font>

129
00:14:22,462 --> 00:14:25,466
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>And what happened
after your son woke up?</b></font>

130
00:14:29,702 --> 00:14:30,908
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Josh!</b></font>

131
00:14:32,739 --> 00:14:34,844
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Josh, where are you'?</b></font>

132
00:14:35,675 --> 00:14:37,552
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Josh!</b></font>

133
00:14:53,159 --> 00:14:54,263
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Renai.</b></font>

134
00:14:54,394 --> 00:14:56,237
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm right here.</b></font>

135
00:14:56,329 --> 00:14:58,240
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Renai!
What?</b></font>

136
00:15:01,167 --> 00:15:02,874
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Oh, no, no, no.</b></font>

137
00:15:02,935 --> 00:15:04,505
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Elise! Elise!</b></font>

138
00:15:05,037 --> 00:15:07,574
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Mom, get Dalton out of here!
Call an ambulance!</b></font>

139
00:15:07,673 --> 00:15:08,879
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No, no, no. Elise!</b></font>

140
00:15:08,941 --> 00:15:10,852
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Oh, no!</b></font>

141
00:15:10,910 --> 00:15:12,287
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No, no!</b></font>

142
00:15:16,182 --> 00:15:17,354
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What'?</b></font>

143
00:15:17,583 --> 00:15:19,756
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Why are you looking
at me like that?</b></font>

144
00:15:21,287 --> 00:15:22,732
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You think I did this?</b></font>

145
00:15:26,692 --> 00:15:28,638
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Did you believe him?</b></font>

146
00:15:28,761 --> 00:15:30,570
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>He's my husband. That's
not what I asked.</b></font>

147
00:15:30,630 --> 00:15:35,079
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yes, I believed him. My husband
isn't capable of killing anybody.</b></font>

148
00:15:35,868 --> 00:15:38,974
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>This is a photo Elise took
seconds before she was killed.</b></font>

149
00:15:39,071 --> 00:15:41,608
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Can you tell me who that
is in this picture?</b></font>

150
00:15:42,608 --> 00:15:46,988
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>There were a lot of strange
things happening in our house.</b></font>

151
00:15:47,079 --> 00:15:49,116
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I saw apparitions,
lots of them.</b></font>

152
00:15:49,215 --> 00:15:52,219
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Are you telling me that this
is a photograph of a ghost'?</b></font>

153
00:15:52,552 --> 00:15:55,499
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Listen, I'm not interested
in ghosts, Mrs. Lambert.</b></font>

154
00:15:55,588 --> 00:15:58,228
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm interested in the living
people who create them.</b></font>

155
00:16:00,927 --> 00:16:02,736
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Elise has marks on her neck</b></font>

156
00:16:02,795 --> 00:16:04,900
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>that were put there
by human hands.</b></font>

157
00:16:06,065 --> 00:16:11,071
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'll let you know if forensics
matches those marks to your husband.</b></font>

158
00:16:20,079 --> 00:16:21,285
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Jessica, we're home.</b></font>

159
00:16:21,347 --> 00:16:22,325
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hey, guys.</b></font>

160
00:16:22,415 --> 00:16:26,158
