00:32:56,608 --> 00:32:59,612
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Whatever it was
that killed Elise,</b></font>

320
00:33:00,745 --> 00:33:04,090
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>whatever it was that
was haunting my family</b></font>

321
00:33:05,617 --> 00:33:07,426
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>is not done with us.</b></font>

322
00:33:09,087 --> 00:33:13,467
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Last night I saw
someone in my house.</b></font>

323
00:33:15,427 --> 00:33:16,929
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I need your help.</b></font>

324
00:33:17,529 --> 00:33:20,100
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Do you remember the first
time Elise visited your house</b></font>

325
00:33:20,165 --> 00:33:22,202
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>to talk to Josh
when he was a boy?</b></font>

326
00:33:22,300 --> 00:33:25,144
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No. I did a lot
to try to..</b></font>

327
00:33:25,203 --> 00:33:28,810
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Try to forget that part of
my life, until recently.</b></font>

328
00:33:28,874 --> 00:33:31,354
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>All right. Well,
Elise hypnotized him,</b></font>

329
00:33:31,443 --> 00:33:33,548
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>asked him a series
of questions.</b></font>

330
00:33:33,645 --> 00:33:36,990
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I digitized the actual footage
taken from the night.</b></font>

331
00:33:38,049 --> 00:33:41,622
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I cropped and
lightened the image.</b></font>

332
00:33:45,056 --> 00:33:46,057
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What'?</b></font>

333
00:33:46,491 --> 00:33:48,903
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Lorraine, is that Josh?</b></font>

334
00:33:50,395 --> 00:33:51,874
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>How is that possible?</i></b></font>

335
00:33:53,298 --> 00:33:54,743
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We don't know.</b></font>

336
00:33:56,067 --> 00:33:58,547
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>If only Elise
were hereto help us.</b></font>

337
00:34:06,144 --> 00:34:07,589
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What'?</b></font>

338
00:34:28,333 --> 00:34:29,334
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hello?</b></font>

339
00:34:29,401 --> 00:34:32,211
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Renai Lambert,
this is Detective Sendai.</i></b></font>

340
00:34:32,504 --> 00:34:33,505
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Oh.</b></font>

341
00:34:33,838 --> 00:34:35,511
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hello, Detective.</b></font>

342
00:34:35,574 --> 00:34:39,078
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>I told you I would inform you
once I got the forensics results.</i></b></font>

343
00:34:39,177 --> 00:34:40,383
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Well, I got some.</i></b></font>

344
00:34:40,512 --> 00:34:43,254
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>It seems the bruises
on Elise Rainier's neck</i></b></font>

345
00:34:43,348 --> 00:34:45,760
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>do not match your
husband's hands.</i></b></font>

346
00:34:45,850 --> 00:34:48,091
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>We're not ruling
anything out at this point,</i></b></font>

347
00:34:48,186 --> 00:34:49,961
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>but I just thought
you should know.</i></b></font>

348
00:34:51,423 --> 00:34:53,425
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Thank you. Detective.
Uh..</b></font>

349
00:34:55,093 --> 00:34:58,097
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I really needed to hear that.
Thank you.</b></font>

350
00:35:54,185 --> 00:35:58,099
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>♪Row, row, row your boat</i></b></font>

351
00:35:59,257 --> 00:36:02,795
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>♪ Gently down the stream</i></b></font>

352
00:36:19,611 --> 00:36:24,185
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>♪ Merrily,
merrily, merrily, merrily</i></b></font>

353
00:36:24,282 --> 00:36:28,788
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>♪ Life is but a dream ♪</i></b></font>

354
00:36:30,288 --> 00:36:31,824
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Kali?</b></font>

355
00:36:33,792 --> 00:36:35,499
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Kali?</b></font>

356
00:36:35,560 --> 00:36:37,699
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Kali, what's wrong?</b></font>

357
00:36:39,864 --> 00:36:41,844
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Kali! Kali!</b></font>

358
00:36:41,900 --> 00:36:46,713
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What a beautiful little girl.</b></font>

359
00:36:46,805 --> 00:36:48,148
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Don't you dare!</b></font>

360
00:36:49,307 --> 00:36:50,718
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Jesus!</b></font>

361
00:36:55,580 --> 00:36:58,060
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Oh, my God.
Oh, my God!</b></font>

362
00:37:05,890 --> 00:37:07,335
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Kali!</b></font>

363
00:37:08,359 --> 00:37:09,360
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Kali!</b></font>

364
00:37:13,331 --> 00:37:16,403
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Kali!</b></font>

365
00:37:16,501 --> 00:37:18,947
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Kali? Baby?</b></font>

366
00:37:19,037 --> 00:37:21,244
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>My baby, Kali. Kali.</b></font>

367
00:37:21,339 --> 00:37:22,909
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Don't you dare!</b></font>

368
00:37:41,626 --> 00:37:43,367
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>He's here.</b></font>

369
00:37:45,697 --> 00:37:48,940
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Carl, I'm Specs. I'm the guy
you spoke to on the phone.</b></font>

370
00:37:49,033 --> 00:37:50,637
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Oh, hello!
Come in.</b></font>

371
00:37:52,036 --> 00:37:53,777
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hi, Carl.
Oh.</b></font>

372
00:37:53,872 --> 00:37:55,874
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's been a long time.</b></font>

373
00:37:55,940 --> 00:37:57,248
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yeah.</b></font>

374
00:37:58,710 --> 00:38:00,951
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Looks like I did the
aging for the both of us.</b></font>

375
00:38:01,045 --> 00:38:02,251
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Oh, please stop it.</b></font>

376
00:38:02,313 --> 00:38:04,793
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You met Specs.
This is Tucker.</b></font>

377
00:38:06,451 --> 00:38:09,091
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Elise talked about you a lot.</b></font>

378
00:38:09,220 --> 00:38:10,980
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Oh, Yeah, said you were
the second best person</b></font>

379
00:38:10,989 --> 00:38:11,990
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She ever worked with.</b></font>

380
00:38:12,090 --> 00:38:14,331
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Second best, that's generous.</b></font>

381
00:38:16,060 --> 00:38:20,270
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I had been meaning to catch
up with her, to call her.</b></font>

382
00:38:20,331 --> 00:38:22,937
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>But I always kept putting it off
till the next week, you know?</b></font>

383
00:38:23,001 --> 00:38:25,242
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>And now she's gone.</b></font>

384
00:38:25,303 --> 00:38:28,307
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Well, maybe this is your
chance to say your good-byes.</b></font>

385
00:38:28,406 --> 00:38:31,979
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Specs told me on the phone,
but I'm not sure we should..</b></font>

386
00:38:32,076 --> 00:38:33,919
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We have questions
that need answering,</b></font>

387
00:38:33,978 --> 00:38:37,323
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>and the only person we could
think of to ask is Elise.</b></font>

388
00:38:38,449 --> 00:38:40,122
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Please help us, Carl.</b></font>

389
00:38:40,752 --> 00:38:42,493
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Help us contact her.</b></font>

390
00:38:44,823 --> 00:38:47,667
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Everybody has their
own way of making contact.</b></font>

391
00:38:47,759 --> 00:38:50,171
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>This is mine.</b></font>

392
00:38:50,261 --> 00:38:53,799
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I ask questions and the
spirits answer with the dice.</b></font>

393
00:38:54,098 --> 00:38:55,873
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You look for the words
in the letters.</b></font>

394
00:39:01,539 --> 00:39:03,951
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Elise, we are
calling out to you.</b></font>

395
00:39:04,943 --> 00:39:06,547
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Tell us if you are there.</b></font>

396
00:39:19,991 --> 00:39:22,835
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Elise, please talk to us.</b></font>

397
00:39:22,894 --> 00:39:25,898
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Give us a sign that
you can hear my voice.</b></font>

398
00:39:32,136 --> 00:39:34,673
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>All right, I suppose
I should've explained</b></font>

399
00:39:34,739 --> 00:39:36,019
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>that this isn't
an exact science.</b></font>

400
00:39:37,141 --> 00:39:39,712
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Sometimes contact
can't be made.</b></font>

401
00:39:40,812 --> 00:39:41,984
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Elise.</b></font>

402
00:39:43,481 --> 00:39:46,519
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Please tell me, are you here?</b></font>

403
00:39:48,519 --> 00:39:49,896
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Are you here?</b></font>

404
00:39:59,831 --> 00:40:01,674
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'll go get..
- No!</b></font>

405
00:40:01,733 --> 00:40:03,178
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Do not break the circle.</b></font>

406
00:40:25,056 --> 00:40:27,058
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Elise.</b></font>

407
00:40:27,191 --> 00:40:29,762
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We need to know who killed you.</b></font>

408
00:40:29,861 --> 00:40:30,862
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Tell us.</b></font>

409
00:40:32,897 --> 00:40:34,706
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>"She did."</b></font>

410
00:40:48,880 --> 00:40:50,450
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What does she want?</b></font>

411
00:40:53,618 --> 00:40:54,619
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I see it.</b></font>

412
00:40:55,486 --> 00:40:56,487
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Where?</b></font>

413
00:40:57,455 --> 00:41:01,335
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>K-I-L-L</b></font>

414
00:41:07,932 --> 00:41:08,933
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Where is she?</b></font>

415
00:41:11,336 --> 00:41:13,077
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>"Hiding."</b></font>

416
00:41:15,239 --> 00:41:18,914
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Where is she hiding?</b></font>

417
00:41:38,429 --> 00:41:41,774
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Elise, tell us where
lo find your killer.</b></font>

418
00:41:45,703 --> 00:41:49,674
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>"Our Lady Angls"?</b></font>

419
00:41:49,874 --> 00:41:51,854
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Our Lady Angls,
what does that mean?</b></font>

420
00:41:51,943 --> 00:41:53,945
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's "Angels."</b></font>

421
00:41:54,345 --> 00:41:55,790
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Our Lady of the Angels.</b></font>

422
00:41:56,147 --> 00:41:57,558
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's a hospital.</b></font>

423
00:41:59,283 --> 00:42:01,786
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I know because
I used to work there.</b></font>

424
00:42:13,798 --> 00:42:15,471
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Renai?</b></font>

425
00:42:31,883 --> 00:42:33,590
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Renai.</b></font>

426
00:42:49,067 --> 00:42:52,173
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Most of my work
was in this East Wing.</b></font>

427
00:42:52,236 --> 00:42:55,080
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>But it's all closed now.</b></font>

428
00:42:55,173 --> 00:42:56,846
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Now only the ghosts are left.</b></font>

429
00:42:57,241 --> 00:43:00,245
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Personally, I
prefer the ghosts to people.</b></font>

430
00:43:03,614 --> 00:43:06,618
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>The question is,
what are we looking for?</b></font>

431
00:43:07,685 --> 00:43:09,722
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Elise led us here for a reason.</b></font>

432
00:43:10,421 --> 00:43:12,560
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Just forget
the actual building.</b></font>

433
00:43:12,623 --> 00:43:15,729
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Think of the doctors,
the nurses you worked with,</b></font>

434
00:43:15,793 --> 00:43:17,602
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>the patients, everyone.</b></font>

435
00:43:35,546 --> 00:43:39,824
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Mama! Mama!</b></font>

436
00:43:53,965 --> 00:43:55,569
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What is it?</b></font>

437
00:44:05,676 --> 00:44:07,246
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>In there.</b></font>

438
00:44:31,202 --> 00:44:33,148
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What was in this room?</b></font>

439
00:44:37,141 --> 00:44:39,451
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>This was an ICU.</b></font>

440
00:44:40,778 --> 00:44:42,951
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I remember it very well.</b></font>

441
00:44:47,952 --> 00:44:49,693
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Should we do
pizza night tonight?</b></font>

442
00:44:49,787 --> 00:44:50,959
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>How about mac and cheese?</b></font>

443
00:44:51,022 --> 00:44:52,023
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hi, Pam.
Hi, Lorraine.</b></font>

444
00:44:52,123 --> 00:44:53,534
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Mac and cheese.</b></font>

445
00:44:53,624 --> 00:44:55,501
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Okay, that can be done.</b></font>

446
00:44:57,228 --> 00:44:59,367
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Keep quiet.
Don't touch anything.</b></font>

447
00:45:00,298 --> 00:45:02,141
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>How is he?</b></font>

448
00:45:02,200 --> 00:45:04,680
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>His vital signs are stabilizing</b></font>

449
00:45:04,735 --> 00:45:06,214
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>but he's still unresponsive.</b></font>

450
00:45:08,306 --> 00:45:09,876
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>His blood
pressure's doing better.</b></font>

451
00:45:09,974 --> 00:45:11,510
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yes, after we upped the dosage.</b></font>

452
00:45:11,576 --> 00:45:13,578
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Okay, let's keep him on that.
- Okay.</b></font>

453
00:45:13,678 --> 00:45:16,249
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>And when was the last
time you checked the glucose?</b></font>

454
00:45:28,759 --> 00:45:30,830
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's okay.
It's okay.</b></font>

455
00:45:32,897 --> 00:45:36,709
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>A few days
later, I saw him again.</i></b></font>

456
00:45:37,335 --> 00:45:38,939
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>For the last time.</i></b></font>

457
00:45:57,121 --> 00:45:59,624
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Parker, what are you..</b></font>

458
00:45:59,724 --> 00:46:02,637
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You should be resting.
You shouldn't be out of bed.</b></font>

459
00:46:11,202 --> 00:46:14,615
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Listen, I wanna apologize
for my son the other day.</b></font>

460
00:46:14,705 --> 00:46:16,878
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>He was being a nosy kid.</b></font>

461
00:46:36,394 --> 00:46:39,568
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hey, Hillary, why is the
patient from Room 104</b></font>

462
00:46:39,630 --> 00:46:40,904
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>up and walking around?</b></font>

463
00:46:42,066 --> 00:46:43,409
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What do you mean?</b></font>

464
00:46:43,467 --> 00:46:45,970
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>The patient from ICU,
Parker Crane?</b></font>

465
00:46:46,570 --> 00:46:48,641
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What do you mean,
walking around?</b></font>

466
00:46:48,739 --> 00:46:50,980
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I just rode down in
the elevator with him.</b></font>

467
00:46:51,075 --> 00:46:52,645
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>He should be in bed,
on the monitor..</b></font>

468
00:46:52,743 --> 00:46:56,452
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Lorraine, that patient
died yesterday morning.</b></font>

469
00:46:56,514 --> 00:46:57,857
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What'?</b></font>

470
00:46:57,948 --> 00:46:59,427
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>He jumped to his death.</b></font>

471
00:47:10,094 --> 00:47:12,597
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>So, why was he
here in the first place?</b></font>

472
00:47:14,932 --> 00:47:18,470
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>He tried to castrate himself.</b></font>

473
00:47:44,528 --> 00:47:45,700
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Oh, no.</b></font>

474
00:47:46,831 --> 00:47:48,208
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No.</b></font>

475
00:47:48,299 --> 00:47:50,210
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No, not yet.</b></font>

476
00:47:50,301 --> 00:47:52,406
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Please, no.</b></font>

477
00:47:52,503 --> 00:47:58,545
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Your dead soul
is killing his living skin.</i></b></font>

478
00:47:58,642 --> 00:48:00,747
