575
00:58:58,402 --> 00:59:01,542
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's okay.
It's okay. It's okay.</b></font>

576
00:59:01,638 --> 00:59:04,551
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It was just a dream
It's just a dream.</b></font>

577
00:59:04,641 --> 00:59:06,985
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's just a dream.</b></font>

578
00:59:12,249 --> 00:59:14,490
