622
01:06:16,072 --> 01:06:18,780
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Renai!
Jesus! Lorraine!</b></font>

623
01:06:18,842 --> 01:06:19,946
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Where have you been?</b></font>

624
01:06:20,009 --> 01:06:21,317
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I need to speak to you.</b></font>

625
01:06:21,411 --> 01:06:22,481
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Where is he, Josh?</b></font>

626
01:06:22,579 --> 01:06:24,525
