is "Quesadilla."</b></font>

639
01:07:15,131 --> 01:07:16,732
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Say it with me. Quesadilla.
"Quesadilla."</b></font>

640
01:07:16,799 --> 01:07:19,040
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I thought we agreed on
"Unicorn" as the code word.</b></font>

641
01:07:19,135 --> 01:07:21,376
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Uh.. "Quesadilla" is easier
to bring up in conversation.</b></font>

642
01:07:21,471 --> 01:07:22,848
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Not at all.
How would you bring up</b></font>

643
01:07:22,906 --> 01:07:24,106
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>"quesadilla" in a conversation?</b></font>

644
01:07:24,140 --> 01:07:26,540
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's lunch time. It's quesadilla
time Guys, guys, guys, guys-</b></font>

645
01:07:26,576 --> 01:07:28,487
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'd love a quesadilla.
Can I have a quesadilla?</b></font>

646
01:07:28,545 --> 01:07:29,717
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Really?</b></font>

647
01:07:29,812 --> 01:07:31,587
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I don't think it matters.</b></font>

648
01:07:31,714 --> 01:07:33,694
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You'll know if I need you.
It doesn't matter.</b></font>

649
01:07:36,152 --> 01:07:37,825
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Tranquilizer.</b></font>

650
01:07:54,871 --> 01:07:56,111
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Can I help you?</b></font>

651
01:07:57,173 --> 01:07:58,277
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>My name's Carl.</b></font>

652
01:07:59,742 --> 01:08:02,245
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Uh, I know you don't
remember me, Josh.</b></font>

653
01:08:02,345 --> 01:08:05,383
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Elise and I did our best
to make sure of that.</b></font>

654
01:08:05,448 --> 01:08:07,359
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You're right,
I don't remember you.</b></font>

655
01:08:08,184 --> 01:08:11,631
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Your mother called me when you
started experiencing some problems</b></font>

656
01:08:11,721 --> 01:08:16,397
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>and what I saw scared me so badly
that I, uh, reached out to Elise.</i></b></font>

657
01:08:17,260 --> 01:08:19,035
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Now Elise is gone.</b></font>

658
01:08:19,462 --> 01:08:22,932
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I was wondering if you could
help give me some closure.</b></font>

659
01:08:24,867 --> 01:08:26,141
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I need it.</b></font>

660
01:08:28,638 --> 01:08:29,708
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Sure.</b></font>

661
01:08:32,709 --> 01:08:33,744
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Okay.</b></font>

662
01:08:38,548 --> 01:08:39,583
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Phew!</b></font>

663
01:08:39,649 --> 01:08:41,390
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>This is pretty exciting.</b></font>

664
01:08:41,451 --> 01:08:43,431
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I feel like an FBI agent.</b></font>

665
01:08:54,731 --> 01:08:58,110
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Tell me what you're thinking.
Lorraine, what do you know?</b></font>

666
01:08:58,167 --> 01:09:01,944
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I think that when Josh went
into that other world,</b></font>

667
01:09:02,939 --> 01:09:04,577
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>something else came back.</b></font>

668
01:09:05,441 --> 01:09:08,684
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We believe it's a
spirit that's killed</b></font>

669
01:09:08,778 --> 01:09:11,088
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>many times before,
and it'll kill again.</b></font>

670
01:09:11,147 --> 01:09:14,128
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>That's why I had to get you
and the kids away from him.</b></font>

671
01:09:14,183 --> 01:09:17,164
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Last night, when I
looked into his eyes,</b></font>

672
01:09:17,253 --> 01:09:20,291
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>like I have every day
for the last 12 years,</b></font>

673
01:09:20,356 --> 01:09:23,098
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>was the first time
I didn't recognize him.</b></font>

674
01:09:24,360 --> 01:09:25,805
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I was scared of him.</b></font>

675
01:09:25,862 --> 01:09:27,136
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Right now, at the house,</b></font>

676
01:09:27,196 --> 01:09:31,167
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>there is an acquaintance of Elise's
and mine, and he's talking to Josh.</b></font>

677
01:09:31,267 --> 01:09:33,941
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We're going to try to sedate
him and when he's under,</b></font>

678
01:09:34,003 --> 01:09:36,984
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>we're going to try to reach
out to the real Josh.</b></font>

679
01:09:37,040 --> 01:09:38,986
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>And what if we can't find him'?</b></font>

680
01:09:44,180 --> 01:09:46,160
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Are you feeling okay?</b></font>

681
01:09:47,383 --> 01:09:48,794
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm fine.</b></font>

682
01:09:49,452 --> 01:09:51,332
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Just woke up feeling
a little under the weather.</b></font>

683
01:09:52,722 --> 01:09:54,998
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I suppose I wanted to ask you</b></font>

684
01:09:55,058 --> 01:09:58,039
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>if you've any idea
what happened to Elise.</b></font>

685
01:09:58,127 --> 01:09:59,868
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No, I don't.</b></font>

686
01:10:02,198 --> 01:10:03,302
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Look, I..</b></font>

687
01:10:04,367 --> 01:10:07,348
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I should remind you that, um..</b></font>

688
01:10:07,403 --> 01:10:09,644
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm not the person who's
gonna look at you funny</b></font>

689
01:10:09,706 --> 01:10:12,550
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>if you tell me
something unusual.</b></font>

690
01:10:12,642 --> 01:10:13,643
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Mmm-hmm.</i></b></font>

691
01:10:13,743 --> 01:10:16,349
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I've seen things
with my own eyes</b></font>

692
01:10:17,146 --> 01:10:20,184
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>that most people have to
go to sleep to conjure up.</b></font>

693
01:10:21,517 --> 01:10:24,987
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Elise sent me to a place
that still haunts my dreams.</b></font>

694
01:10:26,889 --> 01:10:28,869
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>But I got my son back.</b></font>

695
01:10:32,829 --> 01:10:35,605
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I don't know, I left the
room for about 10 minutes</b></font>

696
01:10:35,698 --> 01:10:38,611
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>and when I came back
Elise was dead.</b></font>

697
01:10:40,203 --> 01:10:41,705
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She had been strangled.</b></font>

698
01:10:45,541 --> 01:10:47,248
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>That's pretty horrific.</b></font>

699
01:10:50,847 --> 01:10:51,848
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I guess.</b></font>

700
01:10:52,248 --> 01:10:53,249
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Oh!</b></font>

701
01:10:54,350 --> 01:10:55,351
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Um..</b></font>

702
01:10:56,686 --> 01:10:59,064
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>When you were a boy,</b></font>

703
01:10:59,122 --> 01:11:02,103
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>you said it was an old
woman who haunted you.</b></font>

704
01:11:02,959 --> 01:11:05,098
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Did you see that same old woman?</b></font>

705
01:11:05,194 --> 01:11:06,696
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>When you were in
that other world?</b></font>

706
01:11:07,964 --> 01:11:09,238
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No.</b></font>

707
01:11:12,268 --> 01:11:13,576
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Okay. Um..</b></font>

708
01:11:20,042 --> 01:11:22,579
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Say, would you like a drink?</b></font>

709
01:11:24,981 --> 01:11:26,892
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Water. A glass of
water would be nice.</b></font>

710
01:11:27,717 --> 01:11:28,718
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Sure.</b></font>

711
01:11:54,510 --> 01:11:55,580
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What you got there?</b></font>

712
01:11:56,846 --> 01:11:58,519
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Huh? Oh. Uh..</b></font>

713
01:11:58,681 --> 01:11:59,751
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Nothing.</b></font>

714
01:11:59,849 --> 01:12:02,261
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I thought maybe you were
playing with your dice.</b></font>

715
01:12:03,920 --> 01:12:05,194
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Excuse me?</b></font>

716
01:12:05,454 --> 01:12:08,094
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Mother tells me you
like to play with dice.</b></font>

717
01:12:08,758 --> 01:12:12,865
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Did She? I didn't realize you
guys had spoken this morning.</b></font>

718
01:12:15,298 --> 01:12:16,538
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's how I do my readings.</b></font>

719
01:12:16,699 --> 01:12:17,700
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Ah.</b></font>

720
01:12:22,705 --> 01:12:24,066
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What have you got
behind your back?</b></font>

721
01:12:27,877 --> 01:12:31,791
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Why don't you ask your dice
what I have behind my back?</b></font>

722
01:12:34,784 --> 01:12:37,458
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Come on, roll them and see.</b></font>

723
01:12:39,889 --> 01:12:42,733
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Mother tells me you were very
good with them at the house.</b></font>

724
01:12:46,462 --> 01:12:48,703
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Come on, it'll be fun.</b></font>

725
01:12:57,473 --> 01:12:58,474
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What..</b></font>

726
01:12:58,541 --> 01:12:59,918
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What does Josh..</b></font>

727
01:13:04,247 --> 01:13:09,162
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What is Parker Crane
holding behind his back?</b></font>

728
01:13:19,328 --> 01:13:20,500
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She was always right.</b></font>

729
01:13:23,266 --> 01:13:24,370
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Shit!</b></font>

730
01:13:30,506 --> 01:13:31,507
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Ah!</b></font>

731
01:13:32,608 --> 01:13:34,178
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Come on!</b></font>

732
01:13:49,792 --> 01:13:51,066
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Quesadilla.</b></font>

733
01:13:55,531 --> 01:13:57,067
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Carl!
- In here!</b></font>

734
01:13:57,767 --> 01:13:58,768
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I got you!</b></font>

735
01:14:46,682 --> 01:14:49,094
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I <i>know you, don'! I?</i></b></font>

736
01:14:50,920 --> 01:14:54,367
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Well, if you're here, I guess I
don't have to ask where I am.</i></b></font>

737
01:15:00,162 --> 01:15:01,937
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>He killed you.</i></b></font>

738
01:15:03,933 --> 01:15:05,810
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>I'm sorry.</i></b></font>

739
01:15:05,868 --> 01:15:08,644
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>That thing is gonna murder my
family if I don't get back.</i></b></font>

740
01:15:08,704 --> 01:15:11,048
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>I am trapped here.
I'm getting weaker</i></b></font>

741
01:15:11,140 --> 01:15:13,450
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>the longer I'm away
from my body.</i></b></font>

742
01:15:18,781 --> 01:15:20,283
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Elise.</i></b></font>

743
01:15:20,983 --> 01:15:22,690
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Elise, she's not here.</i></b></font>

744
01:15:23,686 --> 01:15:25,666
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Well, then we'll
have to find her.</i></b></font>

745
01:15:35,197 --> 01:15:37,302
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Into the Further we go.</i></b></font>

746
01:15:44,707 --> 01:15:48,348
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You need to <i>kill</i> the others.</b></font>

747
01:15:48,411 --> 01:15:51,858
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>It's the only
way to stay alive.</i></b></font>

748
01:15:52,181 --> 01:15:54,684
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Shut up! Shut up!
Get out of my head!</b></font>

749
01:15:54,750 --> 01:15:56,388
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Shut up!
Get outta here!</b></font>

750
01:15:56,485 --> 01:15:58,089
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Get out of my head!</b></font>

751
01:16:10,433 --> 01:16:13,903
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Okay, I've just got a message from
Tucker He says they're ready.</b></font>

752
01:16:20,042 --> 01:16:21,385
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Elise?</b></font>

753
01:16:26,582 --> 01:16:27,617
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Elise!</b></font>

754
01:16:32,354 --> 01:16:34,265
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Don't do that.</i></b></font>

755
01:16:43,566 --> 01:16:45,409
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>What is it?</i></b></font>

756
01:16:45,468 --> 01:16:47,539
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>There's someone
standing in front of you.</i></b></font>

757
01:16:51,140 --> 01:16:52,642
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>I don't see anybody.</i></b></font>

758
01:16:52,741 --> 01:16:54,880
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>He's right in front of you!</i></b></font>

759
01:16:56,712 --> 01:16:57,713
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>He's..</i></b></font>

760
01:16:57,780 --> 01:16:59,157
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>He's talking to you.</i></b></font>

761
01:17:01,150 --> 01:17:02,458
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>What's he saying?</i></b></font>

762
01:17:02,551 --> 01:17:03,791
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>"He's got your baby. "</i></b></font>

763
01:17:03,886 --> 01:17:07,390
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>"He's got your baby. He's got your baby.
He's got your baby. "</i></b></font>

764
01:17:07,556 --> 01:17:10,059
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>He's got your baby.
He's got your baby.</i></b></font>

765
01:17:13,329 --> 01:17:14,740
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>What's he doing now?</i></b></font>

766
01:17:15,064 --> 01:17:16,099
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>He..</i></b></font>

767
01:17:16,165 --> 01:17:18,338
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>He's pointing at something.</i></b></font>

768
01:17:23,305 --> 01:17:24,841
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Over there.</i></b></font>

769
01:17:36,585 --> 01:17:39,623
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>I heard this noise coming from Kali's room.
It was on the baby monitor.</i></b></font>

770
01:17:39,688 --> 01:17:40,758
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Probably just interference.</i></b></font>

771
01:17:40,823 --> 01:17:41,824
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>I don't know.</i></b></font>

772
01:17:41,924 --> 01:17:46,202
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It sounded so clear. It was
like this whispering. It was..</b></font>

773
01:17:46,295 --> 01:17:47,933
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Scared the hell out of me.</b></font>

774
01:17:48,864 --> 01:17:51,970
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Then I went to hear the
monitor and turned up the volume</i></b></font>

775
01:17:52,034 --> 01:17:53,342
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>and heard a man's voice.</i></b></font>

776
01:17:53,435 --> 01:17:56,712
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Iran up there
and I looked inside.</i></b></font>

777
01:17:59,942 --> 01:18:03,321
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Probably just some noise.
Those things always pick up..</i></b></font>

778
01:18:08,651 --> 01:18:11,689
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No! No! No.</b></font>

779
01:18:12,688 --> 01:18:14,326
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>No! Hey!</i></b></font>

780
01:18:18,727 --> 01:18:19,899
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Who the hell is that'?</b></font>

781
01:18:23,832 --> 01:18:24,970
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hold on.</b></font>

782
01:18:26,235 --> 01:18:27,509
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Stay here.</b></font>

783
01:18:27,803 --> 01:18:29,373
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Renai!</i></b></font>

784
01:18:57,833 --> 01:18:59,335
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hello?</b></font>

785
01:19:07,543 --> 01:19:09,045
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>No, Josh, no!</i></b></font>

786
01:19:24,526 --> 01:19:27,234
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Josh! Josh! Quick! There's someone in here!
Someone in the curtains!</b></font>

787
01:19:29,265 --> 01:19:30,266
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Josh! Josh!</i></b></font>

788
01:19:30,366 --> 01:19:31,367
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Renai!</i></b></font>

789
01:19:36,138 --> 01:19:37,481
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Renai!</i></b></font>

790
01:19:43,212 --> 01:19:45,283
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Get away from her!</i></b></font>

791
01:19:45,381 --> 01:19:47,383
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Get away from her!</i></b></font>

792
01:19:51,820 --> 01:19:53,493
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Go to hell!</i></b></font>

793
01:20:15,344 --> 01:20:16,516
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Josh.</b></font>

794
01:20:21,517 --> 01:20:24,361
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>I wish I could say
it's good to see you.</i></b></font>

795
01:20:27,656 --> 01:20:29,260
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>I'm so sorry.</i></b></font>

796
01:20:30,592 --> 01:20:31,764
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>You shouldn't be here.</i></b></font>

797
01:20:32,494 --> 01:20:34,974
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>We all pass through
this place eventually.</i></b></font>

798
01:20:35,297 --> 01:20:37,800
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Hopefully, on our way
to someplace better.</i></b></font>

799
01:20:38,600 --> 01:20:40,375
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>I've seen that better place,</i></b></font>

800
01:20:40,803 --> 01:20:43,374
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>but I came back here
because I heard you calling,</i></b></font>

801
01:20:43,772 --> 01:20:45,115
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>and I think I can help.</i></b></font>

802
01:20:48,277 --> 01:20:50,188
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Carl, what are you doing here?</i></b></font>

803
01:20:50,279 --> 01:20:52,816
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>You are not
supposed to be here.</i></b></font>

804
01:20:52,881 --> 01:20:54,622
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>I failed you, Elise.</i></b></font>

805
01:20:54,983 --> 01:20:56,053
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Oh..</b></font>

806
01:20:56,352 --> 01:20:59,993
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>No, you didn't.
No, you didn't.</i></b></font>

807
01:21:00,456 --> 01:21:03,460
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>You were looking for Josh
and you found him.</i></b></font>

808
01:21:04,960 --> 01:21:07,338
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Josh, you don't belong</i> here,</b></font>

809
01:21:07,396 --> 01:21:09,842
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>and neither does that entity
belong in your world.</i></b></font>

810
01:21:09,898 --> 01:21:11,206
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>I don? know
how to fight her.</i></b></font>

811
01:21:11,300 --> 01:21:13,041
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Out there in the darkness,</i></b></font>

812
01:21:13,135 --> 01:21:17,550
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>she has a home where all her
memories live from her life.</i></b></font>

813
01:21:17,639 --> 01:21:20,347
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Use those memories to draw
her out of your vessel</i></b></font>

814
01:21:20,409 --> 01:21:22,389
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>so that you can get
back into your body.</i></b></font>

815
01:21:22,978 --> 01:21:24,514
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>But where do I find her home?</i></b></font>

816
01:21:24,847 --> 01:21:26,588
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Only you know where that is.</i></b></font>

817
01:21:28,684 --> 01:21:30,061
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>I don't remember.</i></b></font>

818
01:21:31,987 --> 01:21:34,365
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Maybe we're asking
the wrong Josh.</i></b></font>

819
01:21:40,662 --> 01:21:41,834
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What happened'?</b></font>

820
01:21:41,897 --> 01:21:43,524
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I saw what haunts him,
and ifs not a friend.</b></font>

821
01:21:43,537 --> 01:21:45,174
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's a parasite.</b></font>

822
01:21:45,501 --> 01:21:48,038
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I've never felt such
a malignant presence.</b></font>

823
01:21:48,103 --> 01:21:50,083
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>It wants to be him.</i></b></font>

824
01:21:50,172 --> 01:21:55,121
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Miss Lambert, I think your son
has a unique ability, a gift.</i></b></font>

825
01:22:02,117 --> 01:22:03,425
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Josh.</i></b></font>

826
01:22:04,953 --> 01:22:06,626
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>I need your help.</i></b></font>

827
01:22:07,456 --> 01:22:10,960
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>I don't have any memories
of the old woman anymore,</i></b></font>

828
01:22:11,059 --> 01:22:12,902
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>but you do.</i></b></font>

829
01:22:13,796 --> 01:22:15,901
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>I need to know where she lives.</i></b></font>

830
01:22:25,641 --> 01:22:26,881
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>I'll show you</i></b></font>

831
01:23:04,146 --> 01:23:06,786
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>So that's what that was about.</i></b></font>

832
01:23:34,710 --> 01:23:36,121
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Carl?</b></font>

833
01:23:46,688 --> 01:23:48,224
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Josh?</b></font>

834
01:23:50,626 --> 01:23:52,196
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Josh?</b></font>

835
01:23:54,897 --> 01:23:56,899
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hi, honey.</b></font>

836
01:23:57,900 --> 01:24:01,211
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm waiting for the boys.
They're not home yet.</b></font>

837
01:24:01,470 --> 01:24:03,814
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Did my friend
Carl stop by today?</b></font>

838
01:24:05,974 --> 01:24:07,851
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No, I don't think so.</b></font>

839
01:24:24,493 --> 01:24:25,938
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You did this to yourselves!</b></font>

840
01:24:36,405 --> 01:24:38,749
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's been so long
since I felt real pain.</b></font>

841
01:24:38,840 --> 01:24:40,513
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Renai, help me!</b></font>

842
01:24:43,679 --> 01:24:47,525
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I missed it, but not as much as
I miss inflicting it on others.</b></font>

843
01:25:06,635 --> 01:25:08,478
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Renai, get out
of here! Run!</b></font>

844
01:25:12,040 --> 01:25:13,383
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'll come back for you, Mommy!</b></font>

845
01:25:33,295 --> 01:25:35,275
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Okay, guys, we're here.
- Yay!</b></font>

846
01:25:35,330 --> 01:25:36,331
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Thanks, Jessica.</b></font>

847
01:25:36,398 --> 01:25:37,959
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Thank you. No problem.
See you tomorrow.</b></font>

848
01:25:38,000 --> 01:25:39,308
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Let's go, Foster.</b></font>

849
01:25:41,169 --> 01:25:42,671
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I didn't want this, Renai.</b></font>

850
01:25:43,905 --> 01:25:47,114
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She wanted me to kill
you, but I said no.</b></font>

851
01:25:47,843 --> 01:25:51,086
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>But now, I know she was right.</b></font>

852
01:26:02,090 --> 01:26:05,594
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You are a miserable,
ungrateful bitch.</b></font>

853
01:26:05,661 --> 01:26:07,971
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You have no idea
how much you've wasted</b></font>

854
01:26:08,030 --> 01:26:09,509
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>your life being
afraid of the dead,</b></font>

855
01:26:09,598 --> 01:26:12,545
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>because pretty soon, you're
going to be one of them.</b></font>

856
01:26:13,869 --> 01:26:16,975
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Then, when I take you
to my home in the dark,</b></font>

857
01:26:17,439 --> 01:26:20,147
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>you'll realize how happy
you should've been</b></font>

858
01:26:20,208 --> 01:26:23,121
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>for your brief,
little moment in the sun.</b></font>

859
01:26:42,464 --> 01:26:43,704
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Mommy! Mommy!</b></font>

860
01:26:44,466 --> 01:26:45,536
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Daddy! No!</b></font>

861
01:26:54,810 --> 01:26:56,312
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Come on!</b></font>

862
01:28:38,580 --> 01:28:39,752
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Hello?</i></b></font>

863
01:28:45,854 --> 01:28:47,800
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>My name is Parker!</i></b></font>

864
01:28:47,856 --> 01:28:49,358
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>What is this?</i></b></font>

865
01:28:50,258 --> 01:28:52,534
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Did you do this?</i></b></font>

866
01:28:56,031 --> 01:28:57,635
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Don't you dare!</i></b></font>

867
01:29:00,769 --> 01:29:02,043
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>But, Mommy..</i></b></font>

868
01:29:05,207 --> 01:29:06,811
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Speak the truth.</i></b></font>

869
01:29:08,944 --> 01:29:10,184
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Did you?</i></b></font>

870
01:29:12,714 --> 01:29:15,558
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Yes.
That is not your name!</i></b></font>

871
01:29:16,351 --> 01:29:19,696
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Parker is not your name!</i></b></font>

872
01:29:19,888 --> 01:29:23,131
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>That is the name
your father gave you!</i></b></font>

873
01:29:23,325 --> 01:29:25,464
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Your name</i></b></font>

874
01:29:26,494 --> 01:29:28,132
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>is Marilyn.</i></b></font>

875
01:29:29,197 --> 01:29:31,143
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Do you understand?</i></b></font>

876
01:29:33,068 --> 01:29:34,979
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Repeat after me.</i></b></font>

877
01:29:36,404 --> 01:29:39,510
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>“My name is Marilyn. "</i></b></font>

878
01:29:41,810 --> 01:29:43,881
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Say it!</i></b></font>

879
01:29:43,979 --> 01:29:45,686
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>My name is..</i></b></font>

880
01:29:47,082 --> 01:29:48,493
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Marilyn.</i></b></font>

881
01:29:52,654 --> 01:29:53,689
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Quiet, now.</i></b></font>

882
01:29:54,322 --> 01:29:59,738
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>If you don't be a good
little girl, you'll get..</i></b></font>

883
01:30:18,013 --> 01:30:20,425
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Mommy, Mommy, I can go
into the dark place</b></font>

884
01:30:20,515 --> 01:30:22,085
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>and find Daddy,
if I go to sleep.</b></font>

885
01:30:22,183 --> 01:30:23,685
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No, it's too dangerous.</b></font>

886
01:30:23,752 --> 01:30:25,095
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I nearly lost you once before.</b></font>

887
01:30:25,186 --> 01:30:26,460
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm not gonna let
that happen again.</b></font>

888
01:30:26,554 --> 01:30:30,024
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I can find him. I promise I'll find him.
I promise.</b></font>

889
01:30:30,859 --> 01:30:31,894
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I will.</b></font>

890
01:30:39,067 --> 01:30:40,375
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Turn around.</b></font>

891
01:30:50,879 --> 01:30:52,552
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's okay!</b></font>

892
01:30:54,816 --> 01:30:55,886
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Be careful.</b></font>

893
01:30:58,954 --> 01:31:00,228
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I love you.</b></font>

894
01:31:38,626 --> 01:31:41,197
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Destroy her, Josh!
End this!</i></b></font>

895
01:31:46,034 --> 01:31:47,707
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Where am I?</b></font>

896
01:33:15,123 --> 01:33:16,261
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Let her go!</b></font>

897
01:33:16,357 --> 01:33:17,358
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Lorraine?</b></font>

898
01:33:22,564 --> 01:33:23,702
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Where is he?
He..</b></font>

899
01:33:23,765 --> 01:33:24,869
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>He's got Renai.</b></font>

900
01:33:34,776 --> 01:33:35,777
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What the hell!</b></font>

901
01:34:11,646 --> 01:34:14,752
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Parker, help me destroy
the memories of her.</i></b></font>

902
01:34:15,150 --> 01:34:16,754
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>It will set you free.</i></b></font>

903
01:34:16,818 --> 01:34:19,025
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Please let me in.</i></b></font>

904
01:34:19,254 --> 01:34:20,995
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Open the door.</i></b></font>

905
01:34:39,941 --> 01:34:43,184
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Little girls need
to learn to be good!</i></b></font>

906
01:35:03,331 --> 01:35:04,969
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No!</b></font>

907
01:35:24,819 --> 01:35:25,820
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Baby!</b></font>

908
01:35:26,321 --> 01:35:27,493
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hey!</b></font>

909
01:35:27,755 --> 01:35:29,393
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hey, come back!
Come back!</b></font>

910
01:35:33,895 --> 01:35:34,896
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Elise!</i></b></font>

911
01:35:34,996 --> 01:35:36,339
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Josh, go now.</i></b></font>

912
01:35:36,397 --> 01:35:37,842
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>I wish I could
take you with me.</i></b></font>

913
01:35:37,899 --> 01:35:39,674
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>I can't.
But you can take Carl.</i></b></font>

914
01:35:39,734 --> 01:35:40,769
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>What?</i></b></font>

915
01:35:41,002 --> 01:35:42,675
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>I told you,
you don't belong here.</i></b></font>

916
01:35:42,737 --> 01:35:44,444
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>I felt your heartbeat
when I hugged you.</i></b></font>

917
01:35:44,539 --> 01:35:47,076
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>You're still alive.
It's time to live again.</i></b></font>

918
01:35:47,175 --> 01:35:48,745
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>But you both have to go now!</i></b></font>

919
01:35:49,277 --> 01:35:51,279
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Go now!</i></b></font>

920
01:35:51,379 --> 01:35:53,052
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Go!</i></b></font>

921
01:36:19,307 --> 01:36:20,479
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Get away</i></b></font>

922
01:36:24,312 --> 01:36:26,758
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Get back! Get back!</i></b></font>

923
01:36:27,548 --> 01:36:29,152
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Daddy!</b></font>

924
01:36:29,817 --> 01:36:31,455
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Dalton?</b></font>

925
01:36:33,655 --> 01:36:34,827
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Dalton!</i></b></font>

926
01:36:34,922 --> 01:36:36,060
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Daddy!</b></font>

927
01:36:37,992 --> 01:36:39,062
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Where are you, son?</i></b></font>

928
01:36:39,127 --> 01:36:40,504
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Daddy!</i></b></font>

929
01:36:41,396 --> 01:36:42,397
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Oh!</i></b></font>

930
01:36:42,764 --> 01:36:45,643
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Oh, good bay!
What are you doing here?</i></b></font>

931
01:36:45,733 --> 01:36:47,974
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>I came to bring you home!</i></b></font>

932
01:36:49,070 --> 01:36:50,140
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>How did you find me?</i></b></font>

933
01:36:50,238 --> 01:36:51,945
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>I followed your steps.</i></b></font>

934
01:36:52,006 --> 01:36:54,008
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Please wake up!</i></b></font>

935
01:36:55,176 --> 01:36:57,178
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Where are you?
Come back, come on!</b></font>

936
01:36:58,346 --> 01:36:59,518
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Come back to me.</i></b></font>

937
01:36:59,614 --> 01:37:00,786
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>That's Mommy.</i></b></font>

938
01:37:00,848 --> 01:37:02,657
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Wake up!</i></b></font>

939
01:37:03,685 --> 01:37:05,255
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Get back to me!</i></b></font>

940
01:37:06,020 --> 01:37:08,091
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b><i>Clever boy.
Follow me.</i></b></font>

941
01:37:10,258 --> 01:37:11,498
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Wake up.</b></font>

942
01:37:11,592 --> 01:37:13,663
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Come on, wake up!</b></font>

943
01:37:41,456 --> 01:37:42,560
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's me.</b></font>

944
01:37:43,791 --> 01:37:45,737
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Renai, it's me, it's okay.</b></font>

945
01:37:46,661 --> 01:37:47,969
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's okay.</b></font>

946
01:37:48,363 --> 01:37:49,967
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Daddy?</b></font>

947
01:37:50,498 --> 01:37:51,533
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yeah.</b></font>

948
01:37:52,400 --> 01:37:53,504
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Daddy, you're back!</b></font>

949
01:37:53,568 --> 01:37:54,638
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yeah.</b></font>

950
01:37:55,503 --> 01:37:57,141
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Thanks to you.</b></font>

951
01:38:00,174 --> 01:38:01,983
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>My boys. Hey, buddy.</b></font>

952
01:38:07,915 --> 01:38:09,895
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Renai, it's me, it's okay.</b></font>

953
01:38:13,688 --> 01:38:15,998
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I tried reaching you I tried everything.</b></font>

954
01:38:16,991 --> 01:38:18,334
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I played your song.</b></font>

955
01:38:29,337 --> 01:38:31,510
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I should've known it was you.</b></font>

956
01:38:32,774 --> 01:38:35,380
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Only you could
play it that badly.</b></font>

957
01:38:53,194 --> 01:38:54,639
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Bring in</b></font>

958
01:39:03,738 --> 01:39:04,876
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Are you ready?</b></font>

959
01:39:05,239 --> 01:39:06,877
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We're ready.</b></font>

960
01:39:07,742 --> 01:39:10,484
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Ready to forget
once and for all.</b></font>

961
01:39:10,578 --> 01:39:12,558
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No more traveling, right?</b></font>

962
01:39:13,247 --> 01:39:16,091
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>This is the only
world we wanna be in.</b></font>

963
01:39:16,150 --> 01:39:17,959
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Good, Mr. Lambert.</b></font>

964
01:39:18,052 --> 01:39:20,760
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>So then, close your eyes.</b></font>

965
01:39:22,824 --> 01:39:23,928
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Both of you.</b></font>

966
01:39:25,159 --> 01:39:27,139
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Now take a deep breath,</b></font>

967
01:39:28,396 --> 01:39:30,501
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>and just listen to the ticking.</b></font>

968
01:39:30,598 --> 01:39:34,978
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Now feel yourselves getting
sleepier and sleepier,</b></font>

969
01:39:35,069 --> 01:39:39,609
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>and let the darkness
drift further</b></font>

970
01:39:39,674 --> 01:39:42,848
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>and further away.</b></font>

971
01:40:11,272 --> 01:40:13,878
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Who is it? I
have a message for you.</b></font>

972
01:40:13,975 --> 01:40:15,386
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's about Allison.</b></font>

973
01:40:19,547 --> 01:40:21,151
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Is this some kind of joke?</b></font>

974
01:40:21,215 --> 01:40:24,458
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We have a close personal
friend who has, uh,</b></font>

975
01:40:24,519 --> 01:40:26,294
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>spoken with Allison.</b></font>

976
01:40:26,387 --> 01:40:27,457
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>That's not possible.</b></font>

977
01:40:27,522 --> 01:40:29,365
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You better leave now
or I'm calling the police.</b></font>

978
01:40:29,457 --> 01:40:31,300
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Wait, Brian.</b></font>

979
01:40:32,960 --> 01:40:34,030
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Who are you guys?</b></font>

980
01:40:34,128 --> 01:40:36,699
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Uh.. We help
people, ma'am.</b></font>

981
01:40:38,065 --> 01:40:41,137
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>People who've been afflicted by..
Who's the lady?</b></font>

982
01:40:43,070 --> 01:40:44,549
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What lady, honey?</b></font>

983
01:40:44,639 --> 01:40:46,141
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>The lady standing behind them.</b></font>

984
01:40:51,012 --> 01:40:52,013
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Um..</b></font>

985
01:40:52,647 --> 01:40:54,991
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Our friend told us to tell you</b></font>

986
01:40:55,049 --> 01:40:57,529
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>that Allison's
accident was no accident.</b></font>

987
01:40:57,585 --> 01:41:01,260
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>When she was resuscitated
back to life at the hospital,</b></font>

988
01:41:01,355 --> 01:41:02,993
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>she brought something
back with her.</b></font>

989
01:41:03,090 --> 01:41:05,400
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Not just one
thing, many things.</b></font>

990
01:41:05,493 --> 01:41:08,337
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>And they're living here
in this house with you.</b></font>

991
01:41:10,765 --> 01:41:12,369
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Allison.</b></font>

992
01:41:16,404 --> 01:41:18,350
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Allison.</b></font>

993
01:41:39,293 --> 01:41:41,637
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Oh, my God!</b></font>

